OL,3,GNEWSABiker arrested after man seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in crash                          
OL,6,FA man is being treated for             
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after being  
OL,8,Fstruck by a motorbike.                 
OL,10,FThe crash happened in Bournemouth Road,
OL,11,FAshley Cross, Poole, shortly after     
OL,12,F20:30 GMT on Sunday.                   
OL,14,FThe injured man, who is in his 50s, was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital. His next of kin has 
OL,16,Fbeen informed.                         
OL,18,FThe motorcyclist, a man in his 20s from
OL,19,FBournemouth, has been arrested on      
OL,20,Fsuspicion of driving offences, Dorset  
OL,21,FPolice said.                           
